---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Editorial Policy"
  description="How Calcio Inglese sources, writes and publishes Premier League news."
>
  <div class="wrap page">
    <h1>Editorial policy</h1>
    <p>Calcio Inglese publishes original news articles about the Premier League. Our stories are based on publicly reported facts — team news, transfer developments, results and quotes already in the public domain — which we research and write independently in our own words.</p>
    <p>We do not copy or republish text from other publications. Where a story originates from reporting by another outlet, the underlying facts are verified before we write our own account.</p>
    <p>Imagery used on Calcio Inglese consists of original graphics produced for this site; we do not use photographs sourced from press agencies without a licence.</p>
    <p>Spotted an error? Email <a class="email" href="mailto:editor@calcioinglese.org">editor@calcioinglese.org</a> and we'll review it promptly.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page { padding: 30px 0 60px; max-width: 680px; }
  h1 { font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif; font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  p { margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink); }
  .email { color: var(--green-dark); font-weight: 600; }
</style>
